# {{name}}

A [pyreaction](https://pypi.org/project/pyreaction/) app.

```sh
uv run pyreaction dev    # http://127.0.0.1:8000, reloads when you save
uv run pyreaction        # production: no reloading, no debug output (same as `run`)
```

- `app.py`: the `App` component the page renders
- `components/`: your components
- `public/`: files served at `/static/`; `style.css` is linked from every page

Settings live under `[tool.pyreaction]` in `pyproject.toml`.
